>Has anybody some information about this streamer ?

4mm DAT.  It supports 60 meter and 90 meter tapes.  Don't even
think about trying to use 120 meter tapes.  It supports
hardware compression.  The SCSI interface is most likely Slow,
Narrow and Single-ended.  The maximum data rate with compression
is 366 KB/sec.
