Windows 95 does not run on Alpha systems, except possibly in the form of some
SoftWindows-style emulator running under another OS.

FX!32 is for 32-bit applications.  16-bit applications are handled by the WoW
subsystem and x86 emulator that are built into Windows NT.

Some Alpha systems support multi-booting for multiple OSes.  The OSes include
Windows NT, Linux, Digital Unix, and OpenVMS.  Intel-only OSes such as MS-DOS,
Windows 3.x, Windows 95, and OS/2 are not supported.

