If you have a 2 memory slot mlb, you are indeed limited to 133MHZ.  The
system does have a jumper for 66mhz bus speed  (J21 & J22 jumpered), but no
jumper for the required CPU core/bus freq of 5/2.  
If your board has 4 simm slots,  you can enable the 5/2 cpu core/bus freq
with J25 & J27 jumpered.  

CAUTION!!  There may not be proper voltage regulation for a cpu upgrade. I
would recommend the overdrive, which includes the proper coltage
regulation.

