is the standard address 1772150 switch 2 sets this to 1760344, I can't tell
you much more then that, but only one switch should be on at a time.
to fire up the onboard utility;
press the init button on your uVAX, let it count down to 3 and the >>>
prompt
enter the folllowing
>>>d/w/p 20001f40 20
>>>d/l/p 20088004 80000001
>>>d/l/p 20088008 80000002      note: I think this is the only page you
need to set
