>>>d/w/p 20001468 ac		This is the standard address we are writing too.
for the second address this would be >>>d/w/p 200000dc ac
>>>s 400


You should get a Wombat utiltity screen with options like create disk
structure,
format, write disk structure, test disk and manage bad blocks.
I have one of these running at home myself, and it works great! Mine has
run flawlessly now about 4 years, so I haven't had to do this for a while!
Good luck! I hope this helps you.,

