Have you looked at the permissions for the services in question?

First when moving from 4.2 to 5.0, when a user uses a username on the
USE command, the first time this is done that username is used for all
future connections. Under 5.0 ech session can use only one username
for all connections. If you look on the server log file you will see a
message when this occurs. Then as a specific user the guest privledge
is no longer valid. You need to check the permissions for each service
and permit groups of users. Also look at session status display in
admin to see how each PC is identified to Pathworks.

