	instances of operating systems to execute cooperatively
	in a single computer. Galaxy Software Architecture, takes 
	advantage of this new computing model. 

     	Implementation of Galaxy Software Architecture on OpenVMS will
	allow load balancing of resources among the partitions, in 
	real time to efficiently allocate them where most needed. 
	It provides shared memory with a command and database and 
	user cache to all partitions. It supports high availability 
	features of the hardware without bringing the entire 
	system down."

