     	... Starfire, Sequent, SGI] by addressing some fundamental 
	customer requirements.  Industry leading performance will 
	be an order of magnitude over today's TPC-C worlds records. 
	Not just `one-upping' the competition."


	A senior VMS engineer has stated in comp.os.vms that
	*conservatively* Galaxy will allow for a 10x performance
	improvement over other OSes on the same
	high-end hardware.  Several interesting wrinkles here,
	load-balancing CPUs between nodes is a very nice
	feature that is worth looking forward to.

