You need more memory, much more.  32M is nowhere near enough for an
Alpha.  They should come with at least 64, and depending on what you're
doing, I'd suggest 128.  Memory is real cheap these days, check out
WWW.THECHIPMERCHANT.COM.  You want 72 pin parity (non EDO).  Alphas
won't recognize any SIMM below 16M.

