The 20 pin connector is a proprietary plug and you don't plug anything into 
it. The KDA-50 doesn't care which drive you plug into which connector as the 
drive itself will determine the device id. plug the port-A cables from drives 
1-4 into connectors on the bulkhead of the vax. You can then proceed with 
normal boot or whatever you want.





