"BIOS Upgrade for Starion 900 Systems Which Experience Random,
Periodic Hangs in WIN-95. This DOES NOT apply to the Starion 950 or 960

Problem:

Some Starion 900 systems (especially those with 100 & 133MHZ CPU) 
may occasionally hang in WIN95 (this does not occur often & system 
must be hard-booted to recover).

Solution:

Upgrade system BIOS to 1.04R3a

Details:

For Starion 900 systems with TRIO-32 chip: Starion 91x, 92x ONLY
          
