The serial ports may not be wired properly. The serial connector
pinout listed in earlier versions of the manual, including the one
that came with my boards, is wrong. You can get a revised PostScript
copy of the manual with the correct pinouts at the DEC web site.

http://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/axppci/read_me.html

The ROM monitor can use COM1 for I/O, with settings 9600,n,8,1;
the information on this in the manual is somewhat ambiguous.

