The manual you want is the "Dec 3000 Model 300 Series AXP Service
Guide", part number EK-PELCN-SV. I sold my 3000/300 so I don't know if
your LED code is really 5F or FA. It is probably the latter, which is
listed as a memory test failure. The standard advice is to reseat the
motherboard and try again. If that doesn't work, then your memory may be
bad (or in need of reseating too).
