Organization: Emetek
Newsgroups: comp.sys.dec



There is a program called MAGICwindows that will allow your users to run
multiple sessions from a standard VT terminal or PC emulator.

It addition to taking care of switching context between up to 9 programs,
it will print screens to any system printer, includes a terminal lock
feature, learns keystrokes to auto-navigate into newly started programs and
allows system managers to view other terminals for help desk applications.

The program will run on any VMS VAX/Alpha system and requires NO
programming. It is safe since no kernel mode code is used. It won't crash
your system.

To find out more visit http://www.emetek.com or send email to
info@emetek.com.




